- Generalized metrics computation (CC, cognitive, etc.) across languages
- Adapted visitor pattern for tree-sitter nodes
- Fallback to Python ast for Python files
- Configurable languages via YAML
Dependencies: pip install tree-sitter tree-sitter-python tree-sitter-javascript etc. (user must install language parsers)
"""

